This release contains code derived from or copied from the following projects.

GUI-AIMA (https://github.com/sjz5202/GUI-AIMA), Apache-2.0
  - training/src/gui_aima/ and bencheval/vendor/gui_aima/: the GUI-AIMA model, dataset, grounding head and point
    readout, ported to the Qwen3.5 backbone.
  - bencheval/vendor/upstream_gui_aima/: the official Qwen2.5-VL code at commit a0b938e, unchanged.
  - training/eval/screenspot_{v2,pro}_qwen35.py follow the upstream evaluation scripts.

GUI-Actor (https://github.com/microsoft/GUI-Actor), MIT
  - bencheval/vendor/upstream_gui_actor/: the official inference code at commit d98d1bb, unchanged.

MedSPOT evaluation
  - training/src/medspot_strict/core.py and bencheval/vendor/medspot_strict/core.py: the MedSPOT strict scorer.

Prompts in bencheval/benchev/adapters/prompts/ are copied from each model's official grounding code; the source of
every prompt is recorded in bencheval/benchev/adapters/recipes.py.
